{"id":"memorial_100702","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial100700","label":"Call Logs · Call Log 028594"},"label":"02:49 PM","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_100701","next":"memorial_100703","speakers":{"B":"B","A":"A"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_100702_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"Hello, is this the Missilis Research Institute?"},{"id":"memorial_100702_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"Yes."},{"id":"memorial_100702_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"My daughter, Rachel Hope, participated in a Nikke experiment not too long ago."},{"id":"memorial_100702_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"That's right."},{"id":"memorial_100702_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"Can you tell me what has become of the experiment?"},{"id":"memorial_100702_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"I'm afraid we are not at liberty to disclose such military secrets."},{"id":"memorial_100702_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"B","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"But I'm her mother!"},{"id":"memorial_100702_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"A","key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_07_02_description","text":"We're terribly sorry, but please understand."}]}